flowchart LR
    W[Worker Running] --> P{Context Pressure}
    P -->|low| W
    P -->|medium| CK[Checkpoint]
    CK --> W
    P -->|native compact| PRE[PreCompact Snapshot]
    PRE --> COMP[Compact]
    COMP --> POST[PostCompact Rehydrate]
    POST --> W
    P -->|high at safe boundary| ROT[Fresh Session Rotation]
    ROT --> CK2[Restore Latest Checkpoint]
    CK2 --> VERIFY[Verify Worktree/Branch/Head]
    VERIFY --> W
